to a regular moon after that.

00:10:41.404 --> 00:10:43.404
- Yeah sun!
Take it back!

00:10:47.576 --> 00:10:50.932
(cheering)
- Great work everybody.

00:10:50.932 --> 00:10:53.395
- [Zach] We had a lot of
fun here in Casper, Wyoming.

00:10:53.395 --> 00:10:55.090
- Wow, that is...

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:55.932
Thank you so much.

00:10:55.932 --> 00:10:59.561
Why would a little polio girl
want to scratch your back?

00:10:59.561 --> 00:11:00.686
(Becky growls)

00:11:00.686 --> 00:11:02.532
- [Zach] Why do I have claws for hands?

00:11:02.532 --> 00:11:03.635
My nipples are not that,

00:11:03.635 --> 00:11:05.061
they're like ketchup bottles.

00:11:05.061 --> 00:11:06.326
- [Keith] The nipples I guess are just

00:11:06.326 --> 00:11:07.668
a part of her artistic drawing style.

00:11:07.668 --> 00:11:09.556
- You have to remember, don't forget!

00:11:09.556 --> 00:11:11.692
It was the most magical
thing we've ever seen,

00:11:11.692 --> 00:11:13.212
you have to remember it forever!

00:11:13.212 --> 00:11:15.332
- Well, that's it, we're back at home.

00:11:15.332 --> 00:11:17.140
So, we'll see you next time on the vlog.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:18.914
- Thanks for watching, it was a vlog!

00:11:18.914 --> 00:11:21.394
- Yep.
- That's you're line, sorry.

00:11:21.394 --> 00:11:25.491
- No, they don't even
know what's canon yet.

00:11:25.491 --> 00:11:27.452
- [Voice] Glamping.
(cheering)

00:11:27.452 --> 00:11:29.373
- [Voice] Dranks!
- [Man] Just get drunk

00:11:29.373 --> 00:11:30.206
on a Monday afternoon.

00:11:30.206 --> 00:11:31.039
- [Voice] Dranks!
- [Man] That's New York Ned,

00:11:31.039 --> 00:11:32.021
way more attractive.

00:11:32.021 --> 00:11:32.989
- [Voice] Dranks!

00:11:32.989 --> 00:11:35.805
- Tall building.
Tall building.

00:11:35.805 --> 00:11:37.722
(beep)

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.498
- Zero ghouls out of ten.

00:11:44.498 --> 00:11:46.242
- I felt like this one
had a piece of video

00:11:46.242 --> 00:11:47.345
evidence that was somewhat compelling.

00:11:47.345 --> 00:11:48.866
- A door opening, sure.

00:11:48.866 --> 00:11:50.658
- I'm a little flabbergasted
by your rating.

00:11:50.658 --> 00:11:51.674
- Flabber-ghosted!

00:11:51.674 --> 00:11:52.970
- Oh my god.

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:54.003
- Put it on a shirt!

00:11:54.003 --> 00:11:54.836
- Don't high-five him.

00:11:54.836 --> 00:11:55.669
- Thanks Zach.

00:11:55.669 --> 00:11:57.235
- Maybe one ghoul without the sheet?

00:11:57.235 --> 00:11:59.048
- Yo, what does a ghoul
look like under a sheet?

00:11:59.048 --> 00:12:00.618
- One time, at Disneyland,

00:12:00.618 --> 00:12:02.827
I saw the Mickey Mouse
character take his head off.

00:12:02.827 --> 00:12:03.795
- What did he look like?

00:12:03.795 --> 00:12:04.888
- He looked like a guy.

00:12:04.888 --> 00:12:07.159
- Woah.
- He kind of looked like you.

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:08.434
- [Zach] Was that you from the future?

00:12:08.434 --> 00:12:10.274
Did you come back to spy on me as a kid?

00:12:10.274 --> 00:12:11.107
